<title>MEXICO: Televisa to issue 1.6 bln pesos comml paper.</title>
<headline>Televisa to issue 1.6 bln pesos comml paper.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan SA said on Tuesday it will act as financial advisor in the restructuring and operation of a commercial paper program for Grupo Televisa for an amount of 1.6 billion pesos.</p>
<p>It said the issue would be placed on the Mexican bolsa by brokerage house Vector.</p>
